activity-relay (2.4.0~rc6-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Accept valid signed public activities from unsubscribed publishers.
  * Track observed publishers and expose publisher status metadata.
  * Publish maintained multi-architecture containers from tagged releases.
  * Adopt the maintained github.com/thystra/Activity-Relay Go module path.

  * Remove legacy upstream CLI branding and expose the compiled version.

  * Count publishers in the advertised participating-server total.
  * Expose receiving servers separately from all participating servers.
  * Fix Redis activity storage so accepted activities reach fan-out tasks.
  * Make the static dashboard tolerant of mixed asset versions.
  * Use cache-busted static assets and GitHub-safe release filenames.

  * Add an optional ActivityPub operator contact to the static website.
  * Add a one-command website rebuild wrapper and inline rebuild guidance.

  * Document optional, redirected, and custom frontend deployments.
  * Include website source files in published container images.
  * Refresh Compose for GHCR deployment and local RC testing.
  * Hide successful dashboard loader diagnostics.
  * Add contributor guidance and remove accidental pager output.

  * Add upgrade-safe website source and operator content separation.
  * Apply relay icon, banner, and fediverse operator metadata to the site.
  * Remove successful status-loader text from the production dashboard.

  * Add explicit server-local HH:MM summary slots and catch-up reporting.
  * Add manual summary administration commands and archived report bodies.
  * Add mail timeouts and Postfix-compatible systemd sandbox permissions.
  * Add resource-guard unit tests to CI and release validation.

